  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sachin Virendra Gupta vs The Superintendent Of Police And Others on 22 May, 2024 1 847.2024ABA.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay, Bench At Aurangabad. 922 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 847 Of 2024 Sachin Virendra Gupta Versus The Superintendent Of Police And Others ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Borulkar Avinash R. App for Respondent/State : Mr.R.D. Raut ..... Coram : Sanjay A. Deshmukh, J. (Vacation Court) Dated : 22nd May, 2024. Per Court :- 1",
    "facts": "This is an application under Section 438 of the Criminal Procedure Code, seeking anticipatory bail in connection with Crime No.181 of 2024 registered with Ambad Police Station, Dist. Jalna, for the offences punishable under sections 188, 273, 328 r/w 34 of the Indian Penal Code and section 59 of the Food Safety and Standard Act.",
    "arguments": "2. The learned advocate for the applicant pointed out the the report lodged against the applicant and co-accused. It is averred in the report that the applicant along with the driver Shaikh Soheb Shaikh Vazir were proceeding with prohibited Gutka of Rs.3,34,220/-. 3. The learned advocate for the applicant submits that the applicant was not owner of the alleged Innova Car.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. The learned advocate for the applicant pointed out the the report lodged against the applicant and co-accused. It is averred in the report that the applicant along with the driver Shaikh Soheb Shaikh Vazir were proceeding with prohibited Gutka of Rs.3,34,220/-. 3. The learned advocate for the applicant submits that the applicant was not owner of the alleged Innova Car.",
